<title>UK: CSFB set calls on Hoechst AG and Volkswagen AG.</title>
<headline>CSFB set calls on Hoechst AG and Volkswagen AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Effecten GmbH has issued two million American-style call warrants, one million each on Hoechst AG and Volkswagen AG lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.NOV.96-30.DEC.97   PAYDATE	22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE    STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING  SPOT</p>
<p> HOECHST    63 DEM    6.27 DEM  9.63 PCT    10.38 X 63.2O DEM</p>
<p> VOLKSWAGEN 620 DEM   5.75 DEM  8.47 PCT    11.72 X 624.60 DEM</p>
<p> ONE HOECHST WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> TEN VOLKSWAGEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
